Al Safa district is a meeting place of the past and the present. The area is located between the famous Palm Jumeirah coast (Palm Jumeirah) and the main Dubai highway Sheikh Zayed Road (Sheikh Zayed Road). Previously, the area was considered a poor suburb of Dubai, but then, over time, it acquired multi-storey mansions and became one of the most elite and expensive areas of the city.

The developer of Al Safa is one of the largest construction companies in the UAE, Damac Properties. One of the great advantages of this construction company is the development and development of not only the object itself, but also the territory adjacent to the object. This is, of course, a big plus of the company, because this way provides a comfortable standard of living for potential buyers of real estate.

Since 2016, the Dubai Water Canal route runs through the Al Safa district. Al Safa 1

This is an elite residential complex consisting of two towers. Each tower will be 60 floors high. It is assumed that 7 residences will be located on each floor. Due to this, the complex is ideal for those who adhere to a more secluded lifestyle, love peace and quiet, but, at the same time, are not ready to give up the benefits of civilization. The windows offer stunning views of the city. The unusual interior of the building and hanging gardens undoubtedly attract a large number of people who want to buy real estate in Dubai.

Al Safa 2

Another elite residential complex, also consisting of two towers (the height of the first is 44 floors, the second is 60 floors). The design of the residences, as well as for the Safa 1 complex, was developed by the famous jewelry brand De Grisogono. Unique design and multifunctional furniture are the main features of the Al Safa 2 complex. Just imagine: with a slight movement, the bed folds and the bedroom turns into a day office. And what about the mirrored glass in the kitchen, which allows you to make a place for parties out of the kitchen? All this and much more will be possible thanks to the De Grisogono brand and the Damac Properties construction company.

If you are planning to buy a property in Dubai, it is definitely worth taking a closer look at the Al Safa area. After all, there are a lot of opportunities for a comfortable stay and the business part of the city is concentrated here. The Chinese Consulate in Dubai is located in the Al Safa district. The best international schools are located here (Jumeirah Primary School, Emirates English Speaking School, and Jumeirah English Speaking School).

Everything you need for permanent residence is presented in the Al Safa area: Pharmacies and hospitals;
Spas and beauty salons;
Schools and gardens;
Yacht Club;
Skate Park;
Fitness centers;
Mosques, temples and cathedrals;
Shopping and entertainment centers;
Running and cycling tracks;
Cafes and restaurants.
